    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$friend_intro",
        "key": "$friend_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "'Wanted: Multiple staff members for a Multimedia Escape Experience event\u2014'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Staff required to take charge in planning escape rooms in whole, for an urgent and pressing adventurous atmosphere.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Staff required to plan deciphering and mechanisms within escape rooms.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Staff required to\u2014'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "'\u2014act out roles.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Design (until opening) to last one month. Salaried for the duration, with three meals a day included.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Interested operators and staff aboard, please find details at the Human Resources Department.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "Multimedia escape experience...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "name2": "char_436_whispr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard it's a new manner of entertainment, one that emphasizes stimulating the senses and immersive experiences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems as though... most escape experiences are themed to rely principally on elements of terror and suspense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd seen one, some time before. Its theme was an underground labyrinth in Minos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Truthfully, I wanted very much to give it a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that day, the A1 Detachment's Operators told me after experiencing it themselves\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "'It scared me to death!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet, while they told me that, they seemed to be so happy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1#5",
        "name2": "char_436_whispr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Fear, but with joy?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hm... Enjoying being frightened?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "name2": "char_436_whispr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't dare go back then, and now that I think of it, maybe I regret that a little...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps, this time, I can. Er, should I ask Weedy to come with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_130",
        "name2": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss.Christine, were you hoping for me to see this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_130",
        "name2": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Meow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_130",
        "name2": "char_250_phantom_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "name2": "char_436_whispr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe I understand what you mean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "name2": "char_436_whispr",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're leaving, now? So, have you decided on where to go for your vacation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Whisperain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_250_phantom_1",
        "name2": "char_436_whispr",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just some concept of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the right amount of fear can serve to bring others merriment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom"
    },
